{"id": 2821, "modified_gmt": "2026-11-16T17:18:05", "meta": {"_acf_changed": false, "footnotes": "", "_elementor_edit_mode": "builder", "_elementor_template_type": "wp-page", "_elementor_data": "[{\"id\": \"7d343f1\", \"elType\": \"container\", \"settings\": {\"content_width\": \"full\", \"css_classes\": \"cc-wrap\", \"padding\": {\"unit\": \"px\", \"top\": \"0\", \"right\": \"0\", \"bottom\": \"0\", \"left\": \"0\", \"isLinked\": true}, \"flex_gap\": {\"unit\": \"px\", \"size\": 0, \"column\": \"0\", \"row\": \"0\"}}, \"elements\": [{\"id\": \"efb62f2\", \"elType\": \"widget\", \"widgetType\": \"html\", \"settings\": {\"html\": \"<div class=\\\"cl cl-page\\\"><div class=\\\"hero phero\\\">\\n  <img src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-hero-gravel.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Group of riders on a gravel road with a beautiful field beside\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"in\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"crumbs\\\"><a href=\\\"/\\\">Home</a> / <a href=\\\"/trips/\\\">Bike tours</a> / Gravel tours</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"pill-eyebrow\\\">2027 season \\u00b7 gravel</div>\\n    <h1>GRAVEL BIKE TOURS</h1>\\n    <div class=\\\"bar\\\"></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"lede\\\"><p>Gravel opens up the terrain a road bike can&#x27;t reach \\u2014 white roads through Tuscany, remote mountain trails in Spain or Cyprus, hidden tracks across Sardinia, Sicily, Slovenia or Croatia. Every trip is fully supported by former pro guides, covering logistics, routes, and bike support, so all you have to do is ride.Whether you&#x27;re chasing a multi-day gravel epic or a shorter escape, we&#x27;ve built routes for intermediate to expert riders across some of Europe&#x27;s best-kept cycling terrain.</p></div>\\n    <p class=\\\"lede\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">Can\\u2019t find the perfect one? Build your own tour. Find out more\\u00a0<a href=\\\"/trips/private-trips/\\\">HERE</a></p>\\n  </div>\\n</div></div>\"}, \"elements\": [], \"isInner\": false}], \"isInner\": false}, {\"id\": \"8797fea\", \"elType\": \"container\", \"settings\": {\"content_width\": \"full\", \"css_classes\": \"cc-wrap\", \"padding\": {\"unit\": \"px\", \"top\": \"0\", \"right\": \"0\", \"bottom\": \"0\", \"left\": \"0\", \"isLinked\": true}, \"flex_gap\": {\"unit\": \"px\", \"size\": 0, \"column\": \"0\", \"row\": \"0\"}}, \"elements\": [{\"id\": \"6fb05dc\", \"elType\": \"widget\", \"widgetType\": \"html\", \"settings\": {\"html\": \"<div class=\\\"cl cl-page\\\"><section id=\\\"calendar\\\" style=\\\"padding-top:44px\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"in\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"head\\\"><div><div class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Gravel tours</div><h2>2027 Calendar</h2><div class=\\\"bar\\\"></div></div><nav class=\\\"browse\\\" aria-label=\\\"Tour types\\\"><a class=\\\"chip\\\" href=\\\"/trips/\\\">All</a><a class=\\\"chip\\\" href=\\\"/trips/road-trips/\\\">Road</a><a class=\\\"chip\\\" href=\\\"/trips/gravel-trips/\\\" aria-current=\\\"page\\\">Gravel</a><a class=\\\"chip\\\" href=\\\"/trips/granfondo-trips/\\\">Gran Fondo</a><a class=\\\"chip\\\" href=\\\"/italian-trips/\\\">Italy</a></nav></div><div class=\\\"fchips lvchips\\\" role=\\\"group\\\" aria-label=\\\"Filter by level\\\"><button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"fchip on\\\" data-lv=\\\"\\\" aria-pressed=\\\"true\\\">All levels</button><button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"fchip\\\" data-lv=\\\"intermediate\\\" aria-pressed=\\\"false\\\"><span class=\\\"lm\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=on></i><i class=on></i><i></i></span>Intermediate</button><button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"fchip\\\" data-lv=\\\"expert\\\" aria-pressed=\\\"false\\\"><span class=\\\"lm\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=on></i><i class=on></i><i class=on></i></span>Expert</button></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"tgrid\\\">\\n<article class=\\\"tcard\\\" data-k=\\\"gravel\\\" data-level=\\\"expert\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"ph\\\" href=\\\"/trips/cyprus-crossing-gravel/\\\"><img src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-trip-cyprus-crossing-gravel.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Cyprus Crossing Gravel Tour\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"900\\\"><span class=\\\"tags\\\"><span class=\\\"tag gravel\\\">Gravel</span></span><img class=\\\"flag\\\" src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-flag-cy.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Flag of Cyprus\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"30\\\"></a>\\n  <div class=\\\"tx\\\">\\n    <h2>Cyprus Crossing</h2>\\n    <h3 class=\\\"where\\\">Paphos, Cyprus</h3>\\n    <div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"chip date\\\"><time datetime=\\\"2027-04-22\\\">22\\u201329 Apr 2027</time></span><span class=\\\"chip\\\">7 nights/8 days</span><span class=\\\"chip dist\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"5\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"19\\\" cy=\\\"6\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><path d=\\\"M7 18h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-7a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H17\\\"/></svg>415 km<span class=\\\"sep\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M2 20l6.5-10 4 6 3-4.5L22 20z\\\"/></svg>8,700 m</span><span class=\\\"chip lvl\\\"><span class=\\\"lm\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=on></i><i class=on></i><i class=on></i></span>Level: Expert</span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"desc clamp\\\"><p>Are you ready for the gravel adventure of your lifetime?</p><p>Cyprus offers endless of gravel routes combined with amazing weather all year round with great food &amp; hospitality.</p><p>We have designed a unique gravel trip with 80% off road which takes you to the top of Mt Olympus, and across the island. Don't miss out on this trip if you are a gravel lover.</p></div>\\n    <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"more-txt\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" hidden>Read more</button>\\n    <div class=\\\"bottom\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\"><small>Price</small>\\u20ac1399 | \\u00a31249 | $1649*</div>\\n      <span class=\\\"early\\\">Early bird price until 30/11</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"ctas\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/trips/cyprus-crossing-gravel/\\\">More details</a><a class=\\\"btn btn-go\\\" href=\\\"https://cigalacyclingtours.wetravel.com/checkout_embed?uuid=7789420390&source=direct_link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Book now \\u2192</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</article>\\n<article class=\\\"tcard\\\" data-k=\\\"gravel\\\" data-level=\\\"expert\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"ph\\\" href=\\\"/trips/tuscany-epic-gravel/\\\"><img src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-trip-tuscany-epic-gravel.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Tuscany Gravel Epic\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"900\\\"><span class=\\\"tags\\\"><span class=\\\"tag gravel\\\">Gravel</span></span><img class=\\\"flag\\\" src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-flag-it.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Flag of Italy\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"30\\\"></a>\\n  <div class=\\\"tx\\\">\\n    <h2>Tuscany Epic</h2>\\n    <h3 class=\\\"where\\\">Castagneto Carducci, Tuscany, Italy</h3>\\n    <div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"chip date\\\"><time datetime=\\\"2027-05-31\\\">31 May \\u2013 6 Jun 2027</time></span><span class=\\\"chip\\\">6 nights / 7 days</span><span class=\\\"chip dist\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"5\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"19\\\" cy=\\\"6\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><path d=\\\"M7 18h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-7a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H17\\\"/></svg>490 km<span class=\\\"sep\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M2 20l6.5-10 4 6 3-4.5L22 20z\\\"/></svg>7,100 m</span><span class=\\\"chip lvl\\\"><span class=\\\"lm\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=on></i><i class=on></i><i class=on></i></span>Level: Expert</span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"desc clamp\\\"><p>When you think about Tuscany, as a cycling lover you immediately think about the white roads, cypress trees and rolling green hills.</p><p>Well, we have built a trip that goes around the whole region in order for to discover and immerse yourself in the Tuscany culture and gastronomy. All with your gravel bike, on 80% off roads. Simply a trip of a lifetime.</p></div>\\n    <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"more-txt\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" hidden>Read more</button>\\n    <div class=\\\"bottom\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\"><small>Price</small>\\u20ac1399 | \\u00a31249 | $1649*</div>\\n      <span class=\\\"early\\\">Early bird price until 31/12</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"ctas\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/trips/tuscany-epic-gravel/\\\">More details</a><a class=\\\"btn btn-go\\\" href=\\\"https://cigalacyclingtours.wetravel.com/checkout_embed?uuid=5065115298&source=direct_link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Book now \\u2192</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</article>\\n<article class=\\\"tcard\\\" data-k=\\\"gravel\\\" data-level=\\\"expert\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"ph\\\" href=\\\"/trips/alpine-gravel-escape/\\\"><img src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-trip-alpine-gravel-escape.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Alpine Gravel Tour Bormio Cigala\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"900\\\"><span class=\\\"tags\\\"><span class=\\\"tag gravel\\\">Gravel</span></span><img class=\\\"flag\\\" src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-flag-it.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Flag of Italy\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"30\\\"></a>\\n  <div class=\\\"tx\\\">\\n    <h2>Alpine Gravel Escape</h2>\\n    <h3 class=\\\"where\\\">Bormio, Italy</h3>\\n    <div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"chip date\\\"><time datetime=\\\"2027-07-15\\\">15\\u201320 Jul 2027</time></span><span class=\\\"chip\\\">5 nights/6 days</span><span class=\\\"chip dist\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"5\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"19\\\" cy=\\\"6\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><path d=\\\"M7 18h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-7a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H17\\\"/></svg>320 km<span class=\\\"sep\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M2 20l6.5-10 4 6 3-4.5L22 20z\\\"/></svg>9,300 m</span><span class=\\\"chip lvl\\\"><span class=\\\"lm\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=on></i><i class=on></i><i class=on></i></span>Level: Expert</span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"desc clamp\\\"><p>Experience the Italian Alps like never before. This unique gravel adventure takes you beyond the tarmac to ride the iconic Stelvio Gravel, spectacular alpine trails and historic military roads through breathtaking mountain landscapes. Designed for adventurous riders, it combines epic climbs, remote gravel routes and unforgettable scenery.</p></div>\\n    <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"more-txt\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" hidden>Read more</button>\\n    <div class=\\\"bottom\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\"><small>Price</small>\\u20ac1299 | \\u00a31149 | $1549*</div>\\n      <span class=\\\"early\\\">Early bird price until 28/02</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"ctas\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/trips/alpine-gravel-escape/\\\">More details</a><a class=\\\"btn btn-go\\\" href=\\\"https://cigalacyclingtours.wetravel.com/checkout_embed?uuid=6681342030&source=direct_link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Book now \\u2192</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</article>\\n<article class=\\\"tcard\\\" data-k=\\\"gravel\\\" data-level=\\\"intermediate\\\">\\n  <a class=\\\"ph\\\" href=\\\"/trips/lake-garda-gravel/\\\"><img src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-trip-lake-garda-gravel.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Lake Garda Gravel bike tour\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\" width=\\\"1200\\\" height=\\\"900\\\"><span class=\\\"tags\\\"><span class=\\\"tag gravel\\\">Gravel</span></span><img class=\\\"flag\\\" src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-flag-it.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Flag of Italy\\\" width=\\\"40\\\" height=\\\"30\\\"></a>\\n  <div class=\\\"tx\\\">\\n    <h2>Lake Garda Gravel</h2>\\n    <h3 class=\\\"where\\\">Lake Garda, Italy</h3>\\n    <div class=\\\"meta\\\"><span class=\\\"chip date\\\"><time datetime=\\\"2027-09-07\\\">7\\u201312 Sep 2027</time></span><span class=\\\"chip\\\">5 nights/6 days</span><span class=\\\"chip dist\\\"><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><circle cx=\\\"5\\\" cy=\\\"18\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"19\\\" cy=\\\"6\\\" r=\\\"2.2\\\"/><path d=\\\"M7 18h8.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0-7h-7a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0-7H17\\\"/></svg>340 km<span class=\\\"sep\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"></span><svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><path d=\\\"M2 20l6.5-10 4 6 3-4.5L22 20z\\\"/></svg>3,500 m</span><span class=\\\"chip lvl\\\"><span class=\\\"lm\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"><i class=on></i><i class=on></i><i></i></span>Level: Intermediate, Expert</span></div>\\n    <div class=\\\"desc clamp\\\"><p>Trade the tarmac for gravel on Lake Garda's quieter side.</p><p>Based in Moniga del Garda, explore the vineyard tracks of Valtenesi, the Moreniche hills, the Mincio Valley and the renowned Amarone wine region of Valpolicella. Six days of scenic gravel riding, historic villages and some of Italy's finest wine country.</p></div>\\n    <button type=\\\"button\\\" class=\\\"more-txt\\\" aria-expanded=\\\"false\\\" hidden>Read more</button>\\n    <div class=\\\"bottom\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\"><small>Price</small>\\u20ac1099 | \\u00a3999 | $1299*</div>\\n      <span class=\\\"early\\\">Early bird price until 30/04</span>\\n      <div class=\\\"ctas\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/trips/lake-garda-gravel/\\\">More details</a><a class=\\\"btn btn-go\\\" href=\\\"https://cigalacyclingtours.wetravel.com/checkout_embed?uuid=2303316283&source=direct_link\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\">Book now \\u2192</a></div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</article>\\n    </div><p class=\\\"lvnone\\\" hidden>No tour here for this level yet. <a href=\\\"/trips/private-trips/\\\">Ask us for a custom tour</a> and we will plan one for you.</p>\\n    <p class=\\\"footnote\\\">*Prices in GBP or USD could be slightly different at the time of booking based on the current exchange rate. On our booking page you can choose your currency, see the live price in it and pay in the currency you prefer. By signing up to any of our Cycling Holidays (public or custom) you accept our Terms &amp; Conditions. <a href=\\\"/terms-conditions/\\\">View T&amp;C</a></p>\\n  </div>\\n</section></div>\"}, \"elements\": [], \"isInner\": false}], \"isInner\": false}, {\"id\": \"1bace3d\", \"elType\": \"container\", \"settings\": {\"content_width\": \"full\", \"css_classes\": \"cc-wrap\", \"padding\": {\"unit\": \"px\", \"top\": \"0\", \"right\": \"0\", \"bottom\": \"0\", \"left\": \"0\", \"isLinked\": true}, \"flex_gap\": {\"unit\": \"px\", \"size\": 0, \"column\": \"0\", \"row\": \"0\"}}, \"elements\": [{\"id\": \"06dd45d\", \"elType\": \"widget\", \"widgetType\": \"html\", \"settings\": {\"html\": \"<div class=\\\"cl cl-page\\\"><section>\\n  <div class=\\\"in\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"band\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"https://tours.cigalacycling.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/cigala-tours-custom.webp\\\" alt=\\\"Cigala Cycling Tuscany Gravel tour on the route of the Tuscany Trail\\\" loading=\\\"lazy\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"tx\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Custom tours</div>\\n        <h2>Can't find the perfect one?</h2>\\n        <div class=\\\"bar\\\"></div>\\n        <p class=\\\"lede\\\">Build your own tour. Choose your dates, location, distances and much more.</p>\\n        <div class=\\\"ctas\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-go\\\" href=\\\"/trips/private-trips/\\\">Plan your custom tour \\u2192</a></div>\\n      </div>